<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?>
<app version="1">
	<name>miniCDi</name>
	<coder>Mr. Lechkar aka CatmanFan</coder>
	<version>@PROJECT_VERSION@</version>
	<release_date>@PROJECT_BUILDDATE@</release_date>
	<short_description>Philips CD-i emulator</short_description>
	<long_description>An experimental Philips CD-i emulator.

A system ROM is required to use the emulator and should be placed in sd:/apps/miniCDi/rom (this path can be changed in config.ini).
The following ROMs are compatible and can run discs:
- cdi200.rom (Magnavox/Philips CDI 200 - Mono-I)
- cdi220b.rom (Philips CDI 220/20 - Mono-I)
The following ROMs are capable of loading the player shell but cannot run discs due to lack of emulation of the relevant CD-Audio chip:
- cdi220c.rom (Philips CDI 220/40 - Mono-II)
- cdi490a.rom (Philips CDI 490/00 - Mono-IV)
MPEG is not supported at present.

[Controls]
Wii Remote (horizontal):
  D-Pad - Directional movement
  1 - Button 1
  2 - Button 2
  Minus - Reset machine
  HOME - Shutdown machine
  (To swap between using IR pointer and D-Pad for movement, press + on the Wiimote.)

Wii Remote (motion controls):
  IR pointer - Directional movement
  A - Button 1
  B - Button 2
  Minus - Reset machine
  HOME - Shutdown machine

Classic Controller:
  D-Pad - Directional movement
  A - Button 1
  B - Button 2
  START - Front panel play button
  SELECT - Reset machine
  HOME - Shutdown machine

For details and updates please check https://github.com/CatmanFan/miniCDi.
</long_description>
</app>